{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12377","headline":"题秘书王迪城北池亭 · 钱起","name":"题秘书王迪城北池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子乔来魏阙，明主赐衣簪。\n从宦辞人事，同尘即道心。\n还追大隐迹，寄此凤城阴。\n昨夜新烟雨，池台清且深。\n伏泉通粉壁，迸笋出花林。\n晚沐常多暇，春醪时独斟。\n西南汉宫月，复对绿窗琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}